    "title": "<p><strong>Table&nbsp;2.17</strong> Summary of the main features of Noonan syndrome</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "section authors - not necessary",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 694.6pt; border-collapse: collapse; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" border=\"0\" width=\"926\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 212.6pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"283\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Feature</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 482.0pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"643\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Syndrome characteristics</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 212.6pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"283\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Syndrome MIM number(s)</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 482.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"643\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">618624, 619745, 618499, 619087, 163950, 605275, 609942, 610733, 611553, 613224, 613706, 615355, 616559, 616564</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 212.6pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"283\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Associated malignant tumours</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 482.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"643\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Juvenile myelomonocytic leukaemia, acute myeloid leukaemia, acute lymphoblastic leukaemia, neuroblastoma, oligodendroglioma, rhabdomyosarcoma</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 212.6pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"283\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Associated benign tumours</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 482.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"643\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Central giant cell granulomas, dysembryoplastic neuroepithelial tumours</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 212.6pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"283\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Cancer-related inheritance</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 482.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"643\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Autosomal dominant; cancer risk in <em>LZTR1</em>-associated Noonan (recessive) is unclear</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 5; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 212.6pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"283\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Chromosome location</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 482.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"643\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em>PTPN11</em> (12q24.13); varies with other genes</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: ES;\">SOS1</span></em><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: ES;\"> (2p22.1); <em>RAF1</em> (3p25.2); <em>RIT1</em> (1q22)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em>LZTR1 </em>(22q11.21) and others</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 6; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 212.6pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"283\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Protein product&ndash;associated pathway</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 482.0pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"643\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">RAS/MAPK pathway</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
